##-- Output configuration -----------------
##
## See man 5 sway-output for the full reference.
## List your outputs with: swaymsg -t get_outputs
##
## IMPORTANT: This file intentionally does NOT hardcode any resolution.
## Sway will query the panel for its preferred (native) mode and use that.
## Hardcoding a wrong resolution is the most common cause of a black screen.

## Wallpaper — set on all outputs.
## The path is a placeholder; theme.sh will rewrite this line with the
## currently-selected wallpaper.
output * bg ~/.config/backgrounds/wallpaper.jpg fill

##-- Reference examples (commented out) ---------------------

## Set wallpaper on a specific output:
#output eDP-1    bg ~/.config/backgrounds/wallpaper.jpg fill
#output HDMI-A-1 bg ~/.config/backgrounds/wallpaper2.jpg fill

## Multi-head layout:
#output eDP-1    resolution 1920x1200 position 0,0
#output HDMI-A-1 resolution 1920x1080 position 1920,0

## HiDPI scaling:
#output eDP-1    scale 1
#output HDMI-A-1 scale 2

## Laptop with fractional scale (example):
#output eDP-1 mode 1920x1200@60Hz
#output eDP-1 position 0,0
output eDP-1 scale 1.25
#output eDP-1 scale_filter smart

